{
  "message": "I’m sorry about the disruption, Mei. I understand how a delay can impact important plans. Because you want to keep your itinerary unchanged, I’m not able to refund to your original payment method or issue compensation while the reservation remains as is. For delayed flights, a goodwill travel certificate can be issued only if you choose to change or cancel the reservation due to the delay, after I verify the delay. If you’d like to pursue that option, I can help right away once I confirm the delay details.",
  "options": [
    "Proceed with a change or cancellation due to the delay (after verification), in which case I can offer a travel certificate as a gesture.",
    "Keep the current reservation as is (no compensation/refund can be issued in this case)."
  ],
  "information_needed_to_proceed": [
    "Flight date for HAT045 (so I can verify the delay).",
    "Your user ID and reservation ID (to access your booking details, confirm passengers, and process any change/cancellation if you choose to)."
  ],
  "note": "If you confirm you want to change or cancel after I verify the delay, I can issue a travel certificate (amount depends on the number of passengers in your reservation). Let me know how you’d like to proceed."
}

